imeline by the  power of the master sword since link was  too young to wield it and had to be put  to sleep in the sacred realm and you  know more lore jargon this is most  clearly evidenced by link's own age if  he was disconnecting from the timeline  every time he time traveled he would  remain his original fidget he would  remain his original physical age  regardless of what time frame he's  currently in so technically speaking the  quote-unquote time travel that takes  place in ocarina of time isn't really  time travel at all or at least not like  we normally imagine it it's just that  link himself goes unconscious while time  passes around him forward for seven  years regaining his consciousness when  he's an adult time still passes normally  we just don't see it now time does  rewind when he places the master sword  back in its pedestal but again since  link himself d ages before regaining  consciousness it can be interpreted as  the same thing happening but in reverse  somehow everyone still with me no okay  great let's continue on the point is for  the entirety of ocarina of time story  there is only one timeline simply being  fast forwarded and rewound the timeline  only breaks into two when zelda uses the  ocarina of time to manually send link  back to his original time frame seven  years ago but because the ocarina  remained with zelda while the master  sword returned with link both time  frames lived on meaning the separation  of these two artifacts is what shattered  the timeline into the original zelda's  adult era on the original lynx child era  and physically it makes sense since the  hero of time was literally removed from  the adult timeline as evidenced by the  wind waker intro and possibly even the  master sword check out this theory for  more info on that but okay you're  probably thinking right about now bandit  isn't this supposed to be about what  doesn't make sense on the timeline  you're absolutely correct because this  is where things do indeed stop making  sense see there's a third timeline like  i mentioned earlier one that is  completely disconnected from the canon  literal physical events that created the  adult and child timelines the downfall  timeline doesn't have to happen and  that's the entire problem with it see  lots of people say the words timeline  and reality as if they're  interchangeable but really they're not  the reason why i'm being such a stickler  about this is because the adult and  child timelines are just that they were  initially one timeline that was  shattered into two by the power of  omnipotent artifacts the events of which  happened canonically and cannot be  debated since you have to refer to the  end of ocarina of time as when zelda  sent link back instead of if zelda sent  link back since it did happen no matter  what however the downfall quote-unquote  timeline is based on the mere  possibility that ganondorf defeated the  hero of time this is not canonical and  can absolutely be debated because you  can't say when ganondorf defeated link  you have to say if ganondorf defeated  link instead of a timeline this is an  alternate reality that unfortunately  branches into other canonical games and  that is precisely why it's so messy  because why stop there why isn't there a  new alternate reality that branches off  of the official timeline every time link  faces a new enemy isn't death around  literally every corner how many hundreds  thousands millions of alternate  realities are out there am i thinking a  bit too much into this probably i need  to stop watching rick and morty but  anyway that miss amigos is reason number  three for why the official zelda  timeline is literally impossible and  with that i conclude my essay what did  you guys think though do you agree or do  you disagree and believe that the  timeline is actually perfectly  functional let me know in the comments  below please consider leaving a like if  you enjoyed the video or just my efforts  into making it and subscribe if you  haven't already for many more to come  huge thanks as always to my bandit crew  who make my day every day and hey if  you're wanting to help out but don't  want to like you know sign up for  youtube memberships or patreon stuff i  just opened a kofi account so feel free  to buy me a coffee if you're feeling  nice coffee is my life fuel that's all  i've got in this one so i hope everyone  has a wonderful rest of your day this is  bandit looking forward to seeing you  next time and signing out  [Music]  you

